From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: annotate gptneox graph semantics

Generated by tools/skippy-stage-rewriter from compiler-proven builder
shapes. Auxiliary sidecars and whole-model multi-domain graphs are proven
separately and remain outside the primary decoder stage interval.

---
diff --git a/src/models/gptneox.cpp b/src/models/gptneox.cpp
index 8217e5a8a71db7decb5411779c442d827a33e7ff..366277122a9f88c452329199030875a13720643b 100644
--- a/src/models/gptneox.cpp
+++ b/src/models/gptneox.cpp
@@ -102,6 +102,8 @@ llama_model_gptneox::graph::graph(const llm_graph_params & params) : llm_graph_c
     ggml_tensor * inp_out_ids = build_inp_out_ids();
 
     for (int il = 0; il < n_layer; ++il) {
+        begin_block(inpL, il);
+
         cur = build_norm(inpL,
                 model.layers[il].attn_norm,
                 model.layers[il].attn_norm_b,
@@ -191,6 +193,7 @@ llama_model_gptneox::graph::graph(const llm_graph_params & params) : llm_graph_c
             // input for next layer
             inpL = cur;
         }
+        end_block(inpL, il);
     }
 
     cur = build_norm(inpL,
